      "duration": 13.061,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，就像我们写作文一样，一笔一画从头写到尾。",
      "start": 72.878,
      "duration": 5.79,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。但扩散模型走的是完全不同的路线，它先有一个模糊的整体轮廓，然后反复迭代、逐步清晰，最后才输出成型的结果。你注意啊，这两种范式之前基本是井水不犯河水，各有各擅长的领域。",
      "start": 79.13,
      "duration": 17.129,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那今天这个Agentic扩散模型牛在哪儿？",
      "start": 96.71,
      "duration": 4.746,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "牛在它第一次把扩散范式用到了长程Agent任务上。你想想，Agent干的都是多步骤的事儿，帮你订机票、查资料、规划行程、写代码，中间任何一步出错都可能影响后续所有步骤。传统自回归模型走到第十步发现第三步就错了，基本只能全部推倒重来。",
      "start": 101.956,
      "duration": 23.051,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那扩散模型呢？",
      "start": 125.445,
      "duration": 1.872,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "扩散模型可以边生成边回头检查、边修正，这个能力放在Agent场景里简直就是量身定做。更关键的是，它把上下文窗口做到了128K，直接追平了顶尖的自回归模型，意味着在长文本处理能力上它已经没有明显短板了。",
      "start": 127.778,
      "duration": 20.003,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我特别好奇，这个事情对整个行业意味着什么？毕竟以前大家都觉得Transformer一统天下，架构层面的创新好像很久没出现过了。",
      "start": 148.226,
      "duration": 10.667,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，这意味着Agent时代的底层推理引擎可能从单一范式走向双轨并行。长程规划用扩散，短文本生成用自回归，不同任务选不同范式。这对开发者其实是好事，不用被一个架构绑死了。你注意啊，这种范式层面的变化，影响是五年十年级别的。",
      "start": 159.367,
      "duration": 21.135,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，听完这条我才意识到，今天这几条新闻不是孤立事件，是一整盘棋。",
