        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，而且国际巨头也没闲着。谷歌这次直接把Agent能力产品化了，推出Gemini Managed Agents，配套的还有3.6 Flash模型、Hooks和Triggers机制。",
